 16. Conclusion

The Daily Loaf Bakery website provides customers with an easy and convenient way to learn about the bakery, view its products, make enquiries and find contact information.

Part 3 improvements have focused on adding JavaScript functionality, improving customer interaction, implementing forms and validation, and applying SEO practices.

The shopping cart, product search and checkout features help make the website more interactive and user-friendly.

Overall, the project demonstrates the use of HTML5, CSS3 and JavaScript to develop a professional bakery website.

